# ============================================================
# Project data / generated artifacts
# (large or regeneratable from the scripts next to them — not source code)
# Checkpoints under final_code/ are deliberately NOT ignored (tracked in git),
# EXCEPT the individual files below that exceed GitHub's 100MB hard push limit.
# ============================================================

# --- Files over GitHub's 100MB limit — git push will reject these outright.
#     Needs a separate transfer (Git LFS, cloud storage, manual copy, etc.),
#     not a normal git push. ---
final_code/checkpoint/normal/trocr/model.safetensors                                   # 1273.9 MB
final_code/checkpoint/doctor/trocr/baseline/checkpoint-3954/model.safetensors          # 1273.9 MB
final_code/checkpoint/doctor/trocr/baseline/checkpoint-3954/optimizer.pt               # 2543.5 MB
final_code/checkpoint/doctor/trocr/baseline/checkpoint-4833/model.safetensors          # 1273.9 MB
final_code/checkpoint/doctor/trocr/baseline/checkpoint-4833/optimizer.pt               # 2543.5 MB
final_code/checkpoint/doctor/trocr_pilot/baseline/final/model.safetensors              # 1273.9 MB
final_code/checkpoint/doctor/trocr_pilot/clhaa/final/model.safetensors                 # 1273.9 MB
# Safety net for the same pattern anywhere else under final_code/ (e.g. if another
# TrOCR pipeline gets added later) — these two filenames are always huge for TrOCR:
final_code/**/model.safetensors
final_code/**/optimizer.pt

# --- final_code/data/normal/ (IAM pretrain stage) ---
final_code/data/normal/I_Am_Dataset/

# --- final_code/data/doctor/ (doctor finetune stage) ---
final_code/data/doctor/doctor_raw/images/
final_code/data/doctor/doctor_clean/images/

# --- combineDataset.py's 5 raw source folders, extracted directly into doctor_raw/
# (see combineDataset.py's SOURCE_FOLDERS) - not this project's own output, just the
# original downloads sitting alongside it, never meant to be committed ---
final_code/data/doctor/doctor_raw/Doctor Handwriting Recognition Dataset/
final_code/data/doctor/doctor_raw/RxHand Original/
final_code/data/doctor/doctor_raw/Doctor’s Handwritten Prescription BD dataset/

# --- preprocessing cache, generated from data/doctor/doctor_clean/ ---
final_code/data/doctor/preprocessed_doctor/
final_code/data/doctor/preprocessed_doctor_test/

# --- previous_code/ (archived old versions, not part of the project going forward) ---
previous_code/